      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUGA NZ (1) ran third last start at Gloucester Park over 2536m, beaten 2.75 metres. Talented and has plenty of upside. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Finds a nice race and will take plenty of beating. GRACE ELLA NZ (3) settled handy then took over the lead and maintained the advantage to take out a 2130m race at Gloucester Park last start, adding to her fine third when resuming the run before at Pinjarra. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Big chance in a similar assignment. GINGER SNAPS (2) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance over 2130m at Gloucester Park. BETTER TOGETHER NZ (12) is also in contention although the draw makes her job a bit tougher.",
